<section class="section" id="services">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section-head">
			<span class="eyebrow">What we build</span>
			<h2 class="section-title">Five layers. One standard of excellence.</h2>
			<p class="section-sub">
				From the lamp that turns on at dusk to the platform that runs your company — each build is designed,
				installed and proven.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="services-grid">
			<article class="service-card">
				<h3 class="service-title">Home Automation</h3>
				<p class="service-tag">From voice to everything.</p>
				<p class="service-desc">
					Scenes, routines, voice and app control on a hub that scales with your home.
				</p>
				<ul class="service-list">
					<li>Needs assessment &amp; hub design</li>
					<li>Scenes, voice &amp; app setup</li>
					<li>Install, test, handoff</li>
				</ul>
			</article>

			<article class="service-card">
				<h3 class="service-title">Website Building</h3>
				<p class="service-tag">Fast. Sharp. Shipped.</p>
				<p class="service-desc">
					Marketing sites and web apps on modern stacks like Astro — built to load instantly.
				</p>
				<ul class="service-list">
					<li>Architecture &amp; UX</li>
					<li>Design + build</li>
					<li>Deploy, content &amp; analytics</li>
				</ul>
			</article>

			<article class="service-card">
				<h3 class="service-title">Networking</h3>
				<p class="service-tag">Wired. Wireless. Secure.</p>
				<p class="service-desc">
					Coverage and performance, with VLANs and firewall rules that stay clean under load.
				</p>
				<ul class="service-list">
					<li>Site survey &amp; AP design</li>
					<li>Wired + mesh wireless</li>
					<li>VLANs, firewall &amp; VPN</li>
				</ul>
			</article>

			<article class="service-card">
				<h3 class="service-title">Security &amp; Pentest</h3>
				<p class="service-tag">Scan. Report. Fix.</p>
				<p class="service-desc">
					Scans across your network, web, cloud and devices — with reports written in plain language.
				</p>
				<ul class="service-list">
					<li>Network, web &amp; cloud scans</li>
					<li>IoT / device audits</li>
					<li>Report, fixes &amp; retest</li>
				</ul>
			</article>

			<article class="service-card">
				<h3 class="service-title">AI Help</h3>
				<p class="service-tag">Assistants that actually help.</p>
				<p class="service-desc">
					Assistants and workflows grounded in your own docs, wired into the tools you already use.
				</p>
				<ul class="service-list">
					<li>AI workflows for ops &amp; support</li>
					<li>Assistants grounded in your docs</li>
					<li>Home ops automation</li>
				</ul>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
